---
layout: layouts/piece.njk
title: "The Café — We Open Monday Post (1080 × 1350)"
canvasW: "1080px"
canvasH: "1350px"
pageCss: "/assets/css/fb-open-monday.css"

# The last post before the doors open, made because the opening-day square
# had already gone out once and a repeat image reads as a repeat post.
# Same 4:5 portrait as fb-weekly-specials so the two sit side by side in one
# multi-image post without Facebook cropping either.
#
# The caption is built in fb-open-monday.11tydata.js, so the specials in it
# come from src/_data/specials.json like the specials image does.

tags: studio
studioTitle: "We open Monday — Facebook post"
studioCategory: "Social"
studioSize: "1080 × 1350 px · portrait feed post"
studioNote: "The countdown post for opening week, pairing with the weekly specials post (same 4:5 size) in one multi-image post. Teal ground to contrast the specials post's cream body. The date and hours come from site.json. Once the doors are open this piece is spent: don't repost it after October 5th."
studioW: 1080
studioH: 1350
studioOrder: 23
---
{#- Loudness order: THIS MONDAY, then the date, then the hours. "This Monday"
    leads rather than the date because the post goes out in the final days
    before opening, and a weekday is read faster than a date. The date is
    still there, on a cream plaque, for anyone who sees this late.

    Red only on the cream plaque: red on the teal ground is 1.3:1. -#}
<div class="canvas om">

    <header class="om-head">
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero om-wordmark">
            {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
        </div>
        <div class="om-filigree">
            {% include "partials/filigree.njk" %}
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="om-announce">
        <p class="p-display-italic om-kicker">We open our doors</p>
        <p class="p-display om-when">This {{ site.opening.dayName }}</p>
        <div class="om-plaque">
            <p class="p-display om-date">{{ site.opening.monthDay }}<sup>{{ site.opening.ordinal }}</sup></p>
        </div>
        <p class="p-label om-service">Breakfast &amp; Lunch <span class="dot">&middot;</span> Order &amp; Go <span class="dot">&middot;</span> Seating Available</p>
    </section>

    <section class="om-facts">
        <p class="p-display om-days">{{ site.opening.hoursDays }}</p>
        <p class="p-display om-hours">
            {{ site.opening.opens.time }}<span class="ampm">{{ site.opening.opens.meridiem }}</span>
            &ndash;
            {{ site.opening.closes.time }}<span class="ampm">{{ site.opening.closes.meridiem }}</span>
        </p>
        <p class="p-body om-lunch">Lunch specials &amp; soup starting at 11am</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="om-foot">
        <p class="p-display om-call">{{ site.phone }} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {{ site.social.website }}</p>
        <p class="p-body om-addr">{{ site.address.street }} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</p>
    </footer>

</div>
